SocialØkonomiskVirksomhed is a key semantic signal in CVR.
In practice, this should be interpreted as part of a broader classification context (for example with IEFTilsyn and IEFTilsynTekst), not as an isolated standalone business entity.
Interpretation note

Core signal: true = SØV
Context fields: IEFTilsyn, IEFTilsynTekst
Recommended use: treat as a semantic classification feature in enterprise profiling and compliance/governance analyses

See also CVR Semantic Organisation.
